course: dictionary
lesson: 2575
title: Demo: a short word with many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Demo is a short, casual word. It is informal, and it is short for demonstration, which means showing how something works. Context tells you which meaning fits.
explain: «Ollie tried a shortcut: he secretly downloaded the free demo of an older game.» The clues are free and game. Here a demo is a free, sample version of a game. Try your meaning in the sentence to check that it still makes sense.
explain: «A demo is a rough first recording made to show the idea of a song.» Here a demo is an early version. The clues are rough and first. As a verb, demo means to show how something works, as in «Can you demo the app?»
fact: Demo is an informal word. It is short for demonstration.
fact: A demo can be showing how something works, as in «do a quick demo» in class.
fact: A demo can be a public march or meeting where people protest, as in «go on a demo».
fact: A demo can be a short, early or free version of a song, game or program, as in «a game demo» or «a demo tape».
fact: As a verb, demo means to show how something works, as in «Can you demo the app?»
exercise: «Ollie secretly downloaded the free demo of an older game.» In this sentence, what is a demo? | A protest in the street | A school lesson on maths | *A free, sample version of a game | A computer that has broken
exercise: «In class, the teacher did a quick demo of the experiment.» What does demo mean here? | *Showing how something works | A rough first recording of a song | A public march with signs | A loud argument
exercise: Some people went on a demo to protest against the new rule. What does demo mean here? | *A public march to show support or opposition | A short free game | A quiet walk in the park | A bedroom tidy
test: «Can you demo the app for me?» What does demo mean as a verb? | To count to ten | *To show how something works | To hide from everyone | To delete something forever
test: «A demo tape is a rough first recording.» Why does demo fit here? | It is a type of sports kit | It is a famous performer's name | *It is an early, sample version | It is a final, perfect copy
exam: Which word in «Ollie secretly downloaded the free demo of an older game» tells you the demo is a sample and not the full game? | older | secretly | *free | downloaded
